Z||000005||California Kid||07-20-2001||10:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>I dont know all the results... Just that I didnt win  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Don't ever think you didn't win, you just didn't get a trophy ! You win every time you take your car for a drive, cruise night, or put it in a show. It is a collectable and admired by nearly everyone because you have put a lot of hard work into it to preserve it and added your personal touches.<P>My curiosity on the results is just curiosity, because in all the shows I have entered (which have been numerous), this one was one certainly had the worst officials. Even that being the case there is something to be learned from who they chose to be trophy winners. Because we know the cars we can kind of figure out what appealed to them and it just might make a difference in any decisions we make for future shows.<P>||||reg||6
